# Expectation record for 08_gcc_extensions/003_computed_goto.c
#
# Reproduce one cell by hand with no harness: render the three command templates
# below, substituting the target triple, the optimization level, the source path,
# the output path, and the target's runner (empty on the natively executing target).

program            = 003_computed_goto
area               = 08_gcc_extensions
description        = Indirect jump through an array of label addresses
targets            = x86_64, i686, aarch64, riscv64
opt_levels         = -O0, -O1, -O2
shared_flags       = -static
bcc_command        = $BCC --target <triple> <opt> -static <src> -o <out>
ref_command        = $REF_CC_<TRIPLE> <opt> -static <src> -o <out>
run_command        = <runner> <out>
expect_exit        = 0
oracle_a           = enabled
oracle_b           = enabled
oracle_c           = enabled
ub_audit_flags     = -Wall -Wextra -Wconversion -Wsign-conversion -Wshadow -Werror
ub_notes           <<END
Every jump target is the address of a label in the same function, taken from a fully
initialized array that is only ever indexed inside its bounds, so no jump is made through
an indeterminate target.  No jump enters the scope of a variably-modified type, because no
variable-length array is declared, and no jump bypasses an initialisation that is later
read.  Every dispatch loop terminates and every accumulator stays inside the range of int.
No label address is printed: distinctness is shown by comparison alone.
No header is included and printf is declared by hand, so nothing here depends on a
standard-library header bcc does not ship.
END
impl_defined_notes <<END
The warning gate drops -pedantic for this program.  The subject under test is a GCC
extension, which is by definition not standard C, and -pedantic exists precisely to reject
such constructs: with it in force the program could not be compiled at all and the feature
would go untested, which constraint C3 forbids.  Every other member of the gate is
retained, including -Werror, so no other class of defect in this program is downgraded.
END
expected_stdout    <<END
cg_folded_acc=30
cg_folded_hits=2
cg_runtime_acc=30
cg_runtime_hits=2
cg_loop_sum=10
cg_loop_iters=5
cg_label_addrs_distinct=1
END
